### Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### Obtener mi perfil (requiere token)
GET http://localhost:5244/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN}